  "body": "### Description\r\n\r\nI've two synapse servers. One for testing purposes the other running on production. Both of them are federated.\r\n\r\nI've upgraded today both from 0.34.1.1 to 0.99.2. Everything worked nicely on the beta environment. Production one looks nice from user PoV, but logs are crowded with exceptions.\r\n\r\nHere, a comprehensive extract of the logs: http://sprunge.us/Tzh5lS\r\n\r\n### Steps to reproduce\r\n\r\nI've just installed 0.99.2 on top of 0.34.1.1\r\n\r\n### Version information\r\n\r\n- **Version**: 0.99.2\r\n\r\n- **Install method**: `pip3 install git+https://github.com/psaavedra/synapse.git@v0.99.2+igalia.1`\r\n\r\n- **Platform**: \r\n\r\nRunning on a Debian stable inside a linux container.",
